WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.060
He did it.

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:02.540
He did it this morning.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.759
We've been warning about this for months.

00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:10.790
Donald Trump this morning suggested that the
2020 presidential election be delayed.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.010
He is doing it.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.800
This is not a dress rehearsal.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.070
This is happening.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.070
It's not happening yet.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.350
I mean, he's trying to do it.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:23.589
I get the authoritarian chills when I read
the tweet.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:29.579
Donald Trump tweeted this morning with universal
mail in voting, not absentee voting, which

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:30.769
is good.

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:36.470
2020 will be the most inaccurate and fraudulent
election in history.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:40.570
It will be a great embarrassment to the United
States of America.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:46.840
DeLay the election until people can properly,
securely and safely vote.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:52.920
The president of the United States is actually
suggesting that an election which he might

00:00:52.920 --> 00:01:00.890
lose by historic margins to Joe Biden should
be delayed, postponed.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:06.700
The president is trying to do the thing they
said Obama would do.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.280
Remember 2012 and 2016?

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.159
The conspiracy, right.

00:01:11.159 --> 00:01:19.499
Insisted Barack Obama is a Marxist, dictatorial,
authoritarian nightmare.

00:01:19.499 --> 00:01:25.729
Who is going to declare martial law, send
troops to cities and suspend the election

00:01:25.729 --> 00:01:29.130
in order to stay in power indefinitely?

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.329
Barack Obama was never going to do any of
those things.

00:01:32.329 --> 00:01:37.750
Donald Trump has sent armed paramilitaries
to cities around the United States.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:43.459
And Donald Trump has now suggested that the
presidential election be delayed.

00:01:43.459 --> 00:01:48.670
He wants to delay an election prescribed by
the constitution.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.240
This is a constitutional issue.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.539
This is a red alert.

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:58.100
It is no surprise that today we got the worst
GDP numbers since World War Two.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.590
And Donald Trump's polling continues to implode.

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.590
And Trump says, you know, we should look at
delaying the election.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.350
We have never had anything like this.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:10.750
It's very tempting to say this is unprecedented.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:14.700
We've never seen a we have not had anything
like this.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:18.769
My hope is that this backfires and Trump loses
Republican support.

00:02:18.769 --> 00:02:23.690
I'm right here waiting for the Republicans
that call themselves constitutional conservatives.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:24.819
Come out and denounce this.

00:02:24.819 --> 00:02:26.230
I'm waiting for you.

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:27.370
Make me proud.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.370
I'm ready.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:36.920
This is actually closing in on the fascistic
characteristics that they attributed to Barack

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.819
Obama, which never existed.

00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:40.250
We cannot allow this to happen.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:46.470
And by the way, how is it safe to open schools
and have teachers and students there for eight

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.930
hours a day?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.660
But it's not safe to go vote, which, depending
on where you live.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.890
Takes two minutes, five minutes, 10 minutes,
15 minutes.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:57.250
And it can be done by mail making that argument
irrelevant anyway.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:02.560
Now, as a side note, Trump says universal
mail in voting is bad, but absentee would

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.409
be OK this time around.

00:03:05.409 --> 00:03:10.209
All that we're talking about, all that states
have done, many states, is expand absentee

00:03:10.209 --> 00:03:12.379
voting to anybody who wants to do it.

00:03:12.379 --> 00:03:16.930
It is not some new or different system that
would be ripe for open to fraud.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:24.459
It is not that this is an attack on the foundation
of the country and an attack on democracy.

00:03:24.459 --> 00:03:26.469
Can Donald Trump do it?

00:03:26.469 --> 00:03:27.720
Well, it's actually not up to him.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:33.159
The good news is that it is not up to Donald
Trump to delay the election.

00:03:33.159 --> 00:03:37.579
If states wanted to, you could delay the elections
somewhat.

00:03:37.579 --> 00:03:43.109
But I think that by mid-December, the electors
have to decide who are their votes going to.

00:03:43.109 --> 00:03:46.920
And if you don't have a new president elected
on January 21st.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:51.299
Again, my understanding from speaking to some
constitutional experts is Trump.

00:03:51.299 --> 00:03:55.460
If Trump does, if you don't have an election
and Trump has not been reelected on January

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.500
20th, rather, he's no longer the president.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.299
And it would go to the speaker of the House,
which would be Nancy Pelosi, which I can't

00:04:01.299 --> 00:04:02.810
imagine Donald Trump wants.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:07.230
But this is going to be a question of do any
governors agree?

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:08.950
Is there any governor?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:12.849
Republicans only I would assume that will
even consider saying I think Trump might be

00:04:12.849 --> 00:04:14.530
up to something that makes sense here.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.450
I think we should delay the election.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.100
Or will all governors say we're doing the
election?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.579
And that's basically it.

00:04:21.579 --> 00:04:27.229
