00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:38.660
Put every single one of them on the record,
watch some of them start to equivocate.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.180
Well, you know, I. I didn't see the tweet.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.790
I'd have to see what it is that Donald Trump
wants to do.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.790
I can't hear you.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.310
I think I think our connection is bad.

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:49.580
Simple, yes or no.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.990
Should we delay the election, start putting
