00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:53.990
This is not practice.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.560
This is the game.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.900
This is this is where it's happening right
now.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.699
And he is doing it and.

